{"ref":"BDB, אָדַב","hw":"אָדַב","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָדַב</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. grieve</strong>;<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַאֲדִיב</span> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַאֲדִיב</span> Ges<sup>§ 53.3.R 7</sup>) <em>to cause to grieve</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:33\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.33\">1 S 2:33</a>. (But Dr prop. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָדִיב</span> from <span dir=\"rtl\">דוב</span> q.v.)","next":"BDB, אַדְבְּאֵל","prev":"BDB, אֵד"}